>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Sizing Guide"} badge="Research-Backed" author={author} dates={dates} label="Our standards">
      <Fragment slot="title">How Many Servings in Aldi Protein Powder?</Fragment>
      Between 14 and 21, depending on which Elevation tub you pick up and how heavy the serving is on your label. Here is the arithmetic, tub by tub, and what it means for how long a tub really lasts.
    </ArticleHeader>

    <TableOfContents>
      <a href="#short-answer">The Short Answer</a>
      <a href="#two-tubs">2 lb vs 24 oz</a>
      <a href="#one-serving">What One Serving Is</a>
      <a href="#how-long">How Long a Tub Lasts</a>
